# Normalise line endings in the repository, whatever the contributor's platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites every file on checkout and `git diff` shows
# whole-file changes that are pure line endings — which makes review useless and makes
# format:check disagree with what CI sees.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary